 "memo": {
  "memo": {
   "headline": "Registry-based risk of a poor-enrollment stop by Jan 2020: 2.4%, against a 6.1% held-out base rate (53 of 873 trials); the score ranks trials only modestly (held-out AUC 0.66, 95% CI 0.59 to 0.73) [F1, F2].",
   "evidence_limits": "This evidence cannot show how this trial will enroll, and the comparable set is small with a wide interval [F18]. The registry-based risk ranks trials only modestly, and the pace is a floor because the protocol states no enrollment period [F2, F24].",
   "bottlenecks": [
    {
     "title": "Enrollment period and sites not stated",
     "evidence": "The protocol does not state sites or an enrollment period [F7, F8]. The registry record lists 57 sites, and the pace uses 19 months from registry start to planned primary completion [F20]. That span includes follow-up, so the pace shown is a floor [F24].",
