     "evidence": "On Jan 5, 2017, 35 competing trials were recruiting at 419 sites in total in 8 of the listed countries [F23]. The registry record lists 11 countries for this trial [F9]. Large competing trials in the pack include NCT02674568, NCT02046733, and NCT02200757 [F23].",
