     "evidence": "Eligibility requires more than 2 prior therapies for ED-SCLC, performance status 0 to 1, and treated/stable brain metastases only [F10]. The comparable set had 58 trials, with 3 poor-enrollment stops, and its interval is wide [F18]. Stopped comparables in the pack were NCT01803269, NCT00953459, and NCT00087048 [F18].",
